{"report_id":"phrasing_005","pdf_path":"data/local/generated/phrasing/phrasing_005/report.pdf","figures":[{"figure_id":"fig1","report_id":"phrasing_005","image_path":"data/local/work/phrasing/phrasing_005/p0_x7.png","caption":"Test accuracy during training for the models in this experiment.","number":1,"chart_type":"line","page":0,"text_lines":["Test accuracy during training","EficentNer","—","— QARU","30","—_—_—_—_—_—— Baseline","80","SCRT-bese","—_——","=","—- VGG-16","~~","70","ges","LF","60","je","50","i","3","5","7","9","11","13","1S","Epoch","QAU","Besehne SS","1","3","5","7","3","22","13","1"],"y_span":58.75354268223549},{"figure_id":"fig2","report_id":"phrasing_005","image_path":"data/local/work/phrasing/phrasing_005/p0_x8.png","caption":"Training loss for the models in this experiment.","number":2,"chart_type":"line","page":0,"text_lines":["Training loss","2,00","——","—_-_—-__ MobileNet","1.75","Qaseline","—_—_","ee","Ours","GRU","4 1.25","——","VGG-16","1.00","0.75","0.50","0.25","2","10","18","26","34","Epoch","Transformer","MobileNet","Baceline","GRU","2","10","18","26","34"],"y_span":1.987153162402398}],"sentences":[{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s0","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"Lab Report: Model comparison on benchmarks","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s1","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s2","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"We trained each model for 30 epochs with a batch size of 128.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s3","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.01 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s4","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"Figure 1 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s5","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"Epoch 1 sees DistilBERT post a test accuracy of 52.8% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s6","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"At epoch 3, EfficientNet leads GRU by 19.7 points (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s7","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"From epoch 2 to epoch 14, the test accuracy of GRU improves by a relative 51.2%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s8","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"By epoch 9, the test accuracy of DistilBERT stands at 65.8% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s9","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"Figure 2 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s10","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"At epoch 32, the loss of Ours is 0.32 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s11","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"Epoch 22 sees VGG-16 post a loss of 0.690.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s12","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"On SST-2, Random Forest obtains an accuracy of 83.5%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_005_s13","report_id":"phrasing_005","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"}]}